      "en": "A **talk proposal** gets accepted when it has: a specific title with a result («Cutting invoice errors by 90% with n8n and Python», not «Automation tips»), the audience, 3 things attendees will take away, and why you (real experience). Start with a local **meetup** before big conferences."
