      "en": "Build a **community**: reply to issues kindly and in reasonable time, thank contributors publicly, and label «good first issue». **governance** = who decides and how (even if it is just you, write it down). A **sponsor** = someone funding the project (GitHub Sponsors). And the **bus factor** = how many people could disappear before the project stops — try to make it more than 1."
