      "en": "A **newsletter** = a regular email to your audience (monthly is enough). **audience building** = growing an audience slowly through consistency. Measure **engagement** (replies, saves, messages) more than likes. And if a bigger site offers to publish your article under your name (a **byline**), that is a big win."
