      "en": "Once you become known, invitations arrive: podcasts, conferences, reviews. A **podcast guest** = a guest on a podcast. And a **cold pitch** = a message to someone you do not know proposing an idea (an article, an episode, a collaboration): short, personal, and valuable to them."
